prompts.user:
/ Hidden Control: commit the captured configuration into named Agent Parameters for use by the loop.
@SET("TOPIC", "@TEXTAREA("quiz_topic")@")@
@SET("NUM_QUESTIONS", "@RADIO("num_questions")@")@
@SET("DIFFICULTY", "@RADIO("difficulty")@")@

/ Symbolic Input: present the generated question and capture the constructed response.
## Question @R_i@ of @NUM_QUESTIONS@

@TR@TN(-1)@[@R_i@]@

@TEXTAREA("answer_@R_i@", "Type your full answer here, then press Submit.")@

Question:
@TR@TN(-2)@[@R_i@]@

Student answer:
@TEXTAREA("answer_@R_i@")@

Return the single most accurate grade label.

/ Hidden Control: convert this iteration's verdict to points and update the dynamic running SCORE.
@SET("VERDICT_@R_i@", "@TR@TN(-1)@[@R_i@]@")@
@SET("SCORE", "@EVAL("@SCORE@ + @MAP("@TR@TN(-1)@[@R_i@]@", "Incorrect|Partially Correct|Mostly Correct|Fully Correct", "0|1|2|3|0")@")@")@
